            "ImageDescription": {
              "value": "<div class=\"description\">\n<dl><dd>v. 25 cm</dd>\n<dd>Title varies slightly</dd>\n<dd>In 1903 the two organs of the Society, the \"Verhandlungen\" and the \"Zeitschrift\" were combined under the title formerly used by the \"Zeitschrift\" alone, \"Zeitschrift f\u00fcr Ethnologie.\"</dd>\n<dd>Suspended publication 1945-49</dd>\n<dd>Organ der Berliner Gesellschaft f\u00fcr Anthropologie, 18 -\u00a0; Deutschen Gesellschaft f\u00fcr Anthropologie, Ethnologie und Urgeschichte -\u00a0; Deutschen Gesellschaft f\u00fcr V\u00f6lkerkunde und der Berliner Gesellschaft f\u00fcr Anthropologie, Ethnologie und Urgeschichte, 19 -</dd>\n<dd>vols. 1-20, 1869-1888, 1 v.; vols. 21-34, 1889-1902, 1 v</dd>\n<dd>Proceedings of the Berliner Gesellschaft f\u00fcr Anthropologie, Ethnologie und Urgeschichte were issued in the \"Zeitschrift\", v. 1-2, without separate t.-p. and pagination; v. 3-34 with separate t.-p. and pagination</dd>\n<dd>Subjects: Ethnology -- Periodicals</dd></dl></div>",
